%% Technical view: what runs where.
flowchart TB
  build[docker build: index stage] -->|download pinned PDFs, OCR, chunk, LSA| image[(Image: app + /app/index + /app/data)]
  image --> pod
  user[Analyst] -->|HTTPS| entry{Entry point}
  entry -->|desktop| pf[127.0.0.1 port / port-forward]
  entry -->|cloud| managed[Fargate IP / Container Apps / Cloud Run URL]
  entry -->|OpenShift| route[Route, edge TLS]
  pf --> pod[API pod: non-root, read-only FS]
  managed --> pod
  route --> pod
  pod -->|MISTRAL_API_KEY from secret store| mistral[(Mistral API, EU)]
  pod -->|/metrics/| prom[Prometheus] --> graf[Grafana]
  mcpclient[MCP client] -->|stdio or streamable HTTP| mcp[filing-assistant mcp]
